WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:03.793
Unit twenty-three. Food for Healthy Teeth!

2
00:00:04.768 --> 00:00:08.750
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.896
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:16.012
Today we learn about Food for Healthy Teeth. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.855 --> 00:00:20.105
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

6
00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:26.984
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

7
00:00:30.485 --> 00:00:33.835
Milk. Say it with me. Milk!

8
00:00:37.318 --> 00:00:40.551
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:48.167
Vegetables. Say it with me. Vegetables!

10
00:00:51.665 --> 00:00:55.031
Candy. Say it with me. Candy!

11
00:00:58.533 --> 00:01:01.850
Brush. Say it with me. Brush!

12
00:01:05.351 --> 00:01:09.035
Strong. Say it with me. Strong!

13
00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:20.761
Too much sugar and candy can hurt my teeth. Milk, water, and vegetables are good for strong teeth. I brush after meals to keep my teeth healthy.

14
00:01:20.811 --> 00:01:21.964
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.245 --> 00:01:28.579
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.629 --> 00:01:29.779
Milk!

17
00:01:30.631 --> 00:01:35.657
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.707 --> 00:01:36.857
Brush!

19
00:01:37.757 --> 00:01:43.749
Did you know? Drinking water after eating helps wash food away from your teeth!

20
00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:45.850
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.551 --> 00:01:54.061
Think and answer. Which foods are good for your teeth?

22
00:01:54.111 --> 00:01:55.261
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.383 --> 00:02:01.100
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:03.659
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

